---
// Wordmark: "kostaringet" with a small coin-like mark showing a zero.
---

<span class="logo">
  <svg class="logo__mark" viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true">
    <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="15" fill="currentColor"></circle>
    <text
      x="16"
      y="21.5"
      text-anchor="middle"
      font-family="Hanken Grotesk Variable, sans-serif"
      font-size="16"
      font-weight="800"
      fill="var(--paper)">0</text
    >
  </svg>
  <span class="logo__word">kostaringet<span class="logo__tld">.se</span></span>
</span>

<style>
  .logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.32rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .logo__mark {
    color: var(--accent);
    flex: none;
  }
  .logo__tld {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
